OL,3,GNEWSAAI assisted prostate surgery helps
OL,4,Amen reclaim their lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA robotic water jet assisted by AI is
OL,7,Fhelping men with enlarged prostates
OL,8,Fregain their quality of life, with one
OL,9,Fpatient saying the treatment gave him
OL,10,F"a normal life again".
OL,12,FCheltenham General Hospital has become
OL,13,Fthe south west's centre of excellence
OL,14,Ffor NHS Aquablation, attracting
OL,15,Fpatients from across the region and
OL,16,Fbeyond for the pioneering treatment.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
