OL,3,GNEWSAAI assisted prostate surgery helps
OL,4,Amen reclaim their lives
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe procedure uses a high-pressure
OL,7,Fwater jet to remove excess prostate
OL,8,Ftissue and surgeons say it can preserve
OL,9,Fsexual function and continence while
OL,10,Foffering faster recovery times than
OL,11,Ftraditional surgery.
OL,13,FAndy Ocock, who spent nearly a year
OL,14,Fhaving to wear a catheter, said: "The
OL,15,Fquality of my life is unrecognisable to
OL,16,Fwhat it was before."
